=== hk-07-interp-method-dot-id
from: ORM::ActiveRecord 0.9.4 lib/ORM/ActiveRecord/Relation/Query/Joins.rakumod:146
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: push of an interpolated string with a method call and a variable
--- code
my class Table { has $.name; method id { 'id' } }
my @joins-values;
my $kind = 'INNER JOIN';
my $other-table = 'users';
my $fkey = 'user_id';
my $base-table = Table.new(name => 'posts');
@joins-values.push: "$kind $other-table ON $other-table.$fkey = {$base-table.id}";
say @joins-values[0];
--- expect
INNER JOIN users ON users.user_id = id

=== hk-07-delete-array-slice-grep-k
